  "description": "JUSRUN crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C104 H84 Dy4 N12 O16 S6,C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.538-3.862 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.99-111.69°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(acac)4(L)6(μ3-OH)2]·CH3CN (C106H87Dy4N13O16S6). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
